[34.329, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m It fits per layer, not wholesale. k3s-iac is plain YAML — exactly what\r\n"]
[35.679, "o", "  these controllers are built for. The tofu repos are not: the extensions\r\n"]
[36.829, "o", "  that run tofu in-cluster are the orphaned corner of that ecosystem, and\r\n"]
[37.979, "o", "  you'd lose plan-as-PR-comment with a destroy gate before merge.\r\n"]
