[66.323, "o", "\r\n"]
[66.873, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m For the tofu repos: essentially none — their APIs are public. For the\r\n"]
[68.223, "o", "  cluster it's concrete: a hosted runner can't reach the k3s API at all,\r\n"]
[69.373, "o", "  and a controller that pulls means no kubeconfig ever leaves the lab.\r\n"]
[72.173, "o", "\u001b[38;5;37m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── iac-auto-deploy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
