[107.873, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Yes — auto-sync without selfHeal gives exactly those semantics: apply\r\n"]
[109.223, "o", "  when git changes, and otherwise leave the cluster alone. Flux's\r\n"]
[110.323, "o", "  interval loop is precisely the post-merge validation you don't want.\r\n"]
[113.323, "o", "\r\n"]
[113.873, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mPlan ready — approve it to start building.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[114.773, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[117.973, "o", "\r\n"]
[118.523, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246m  → plan approved\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[120.123, "o", "\r\n"]
[120.673, "o", "\r\n"]
[121.223, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mCalling Write 9 times…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[121.923, "o", "\r\n"]
[122.473, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mCalling Bash 14 times…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[123.173, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Building…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(38m · ↓ 112k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[125.173, "o", "\r\n"]
[125.723, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Done: OIDC roles + workflows in both tofu repos, Argo CD app-of-apps\r\n"]
[127.073, "o", "  live on the cluster (16 apps synced, zero pod restarts), comin canary\r\n"]
[128.173, "o", "  deployed on vm-01. Now let's prove the gate instead of trusting it.\r\n"]
[131.173, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246m  ── plus tard dans la session : tester la porte pour vrai ──\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[132.773, "o", "\r\n"]
[133.323, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m PR #2 is open: it deletes the throwaway TXT record created by PR #1.\r\n"]
[134.673, "o", "  The plan comment flags it loudly:\r\n"]
[135.673, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;174m⛔ Plan contains 1 destroy — the apply workflow will refuse this\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[136.173, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;174m   cloudflare_dns_record.cicd_test_txt\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[137.773, "o", "\r\n"]
[138.323, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mMerge PR #2 — the apply run must FAIL at the destroy gate.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[139.223, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[142.423, "o", "\r\n"]
[142.973, "o", "\u001b[38;5;37m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── iac-auto-deploy\u001b[0m\r\n"]
